  {
    "id": "fujiang:gray-market:agent-hierarchy-privilege",
    "category": "gray-market",
    "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/gray-market/agent-hierarchy-privilege.md",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "代理层级越权（读全站下级 / 改佣金比例）",
      "cve": "无（业务逻辑）",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "8.8",
      "product": "博彩包网 / 代理分销系统",
      "versions": "任意",
      "ports": "80, 443",
      "keywords": "代理, agentId, 层级越权, 佣金, 返水, 会员列表",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "公开资料整理（业务逻辑类，无 CVE）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- `agentId` 从服务端会话取，不接受请求传入；查询强制加\"上级链包含当前用户\"条件。\n- 佣金/返水比例变更走审批流 + 双人复核 + 审计日志；比例上限硬编码。\n- 列表接口按层级过滤并做行级鉴权（返回 403 而非空列表）。",
    "reference_notes": "- OWASP API Security Top 10：API1 BOLA / API5 BFLA。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-gray-market/agent-hierarchy-privilege.md"
  },
  {
    "id": "fujiang:gray-market:api-idor-bola",
    "category": "gray-market",
    "source_ref": "plugin/knowledge/gray-market/api-idor-bola.md",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "接口越权 / BOLA（读他人订单、流水、提现）",
      "cve": "无（业务逻辑）",
      "severity": "high",
      "source_cvss": "8.1",
      "product": "自研 API（博彩/代理/跑分平台高发）",
      "versions": "任意",
      "ports": "80, 443",
      "keywords": "idor, bola, 越权, 水平越权, orderNo, uid, 代理后台",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "公开资料整理（业务逻辑 / 实现 / 配置缺陷类，无 CVE；出处见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 服务端以 session/JWT 里的 `uid` 为准，忽略请求里的 `uid`；资源级鉴权（owner check）。\n- 订单号用 UUID/带签名的不透明 ID，禁止顺序可枚举。\n- 未授权访问统一返回 404/403，避免\"200 + 空对象\"暴露存在性。\n- 代理层级在服务端做\"上级链校验\"，不接受客户端传 `agentId`。",
    "reference_notes": "- OWASP API Security Top 10：API1 BOLA、API5 BFLA。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-gray-market/api-idor-bola.md"
  },
